@startuml
title Use Case Diagram - MARS-OPS

left to right direction
actor Operator
actor Environment

rectangle "MARS-OPS" {
  usecase "Set up colony" as Setup
  usecase "Submit mission" as Submit
  usecase "Check team capabilities" as Team
  usecase "Check resources" as Res
  usecase "Reject mission" as Reject
  usecase "Advance time" as Time
  usecase "Change environment condition" as Env
  usecase "View status report" as Report
}

Operator --> Setup
Operator --> Submit
Operator --> Time
Operator --> Report
Environment --> Env

Submit ..> Team : <<include>>
Submit ..> Res : <<include>>
Reject ..> Submit : <<extend>>
@enduml
